  "title": "Meet a Medical Director: Dr. Elizabeth Henry",
  "summary": "Dr. Elizabeth Henry serves as the Medical Director of Oncology at theMednet. Her goal: break down the silos that exist in academic medicine and make it accessible to everybody. She oversees the editorial team – deputy and associate editors - for each of the five specialties that comprise the oncology community",
